{"server":"cn","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_01_end","groupId":"act47side","stageId":"act47side_01","title":"嘈杂的天空","storyCode":"UR-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act47side/level_act47side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"549832c2d27124993e49b7a07884d967b3ea63e19950d82fe6c306a992b59812","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"“幸运瘤兽”的经理前去注销资质，在工作人员的指点下，他拨通了一个神秘号码。另一边，一名陌生的男子找到高登，自称是前来报到的讲解员奥克里——可园区内已经存在一位同名同姓的讲解员了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥......安德鲁！你又被他们打了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我斯凯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那是你自己取的名字，爸妈说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别提他们！自己没出息就只会在咱俩身上撒气的畜生，他们有什么资格决定我叫什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在特里蒙理工擦了六年的地板，偷听完了所有本科课程，就是为了以后不像他们一样窝囊、愚蠢、没用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你！除了每天往我包里贴唠唠叨叨的便签，还能做点别的吗？我又不是不知道吃饭——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那群人又来了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他妈的......没完了是吗？赶紧的，躲我身后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头混混A (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穿一身白大褂，真以为自己是什么人物了？你和那个小姑娘就是穿上总统的衣服，也是贫民窟来的贱种。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......阴沟里的鼷兽，一辈子都理解不了什么叫伟大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头混混B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再说一句试试？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_i16"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头混混A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街头混混B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天灾？快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还“天灾”？那他妈叫探索！叫进步！"},{"type":"narration","text":"浑身青紫的青年望向天空，忘记了自己在一个肮脏的小巷里，忘记了身后还有一个惊慌的女孩。\n他不受控制地向那束伟大的天光追去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就不担心总辖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她什么时候需要我们担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是同行者，我们只是同行者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只需要做好自己的事，然后......祝她好运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（萨卡兹语）若有一天，卡兹戴尔亦悬于天顶，我将在火炉上镌刻你的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不好意思，女士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能告诉我，那个人，天上的那个伟大的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫什么名字？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_891_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫克丽斯腾·莱特。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g10_ecolab"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜斯提主任，幸运瘤兽餐饮公司明天就会去注销进驻资质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们没通过复检？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"远没有达到标准。他们是最早进驻园区的转型企业之一，为了迎合民众的“天空热”，当时的审核条件不够严格——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们雇佣的体验员呢，会去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个经理连电机的种类都分不清，我猜他只是想借着“螺旋桨天堂”的名头大捞一笔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你刚刚问我什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。你倒是很喜欢这个园区的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更希望它能被直接称作“万星园”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯凯，我知道你不赞成公开环形实验室的技术遗产。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无意指责“总辖代理”的决定，但过分保守的决策只会让我们失去应得的尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一星半点的数据支持让大批科技公司焕发新生；照亮千万哥伦比亚民众的环形实验室，被做成五岁小孩就能玩的益智玩具......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，每个哥伦比亚人都会把“太空”和“宇宙”挂在嘴边，却很少有人记得，这些全新的语汇出自克丽斯腾公开的实验日志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有一个人在真正地悼念克丽斯腾，甚至是你，娜斯提主任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记录和回顾是史学家的工作。我们只需要分析经过验证的数据，遵循切实有效的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这些数据和方向变成了什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近两年莱茵收购了十几个小型实验室，大大小小的项目都在推进，唯独克丽斯腾的遗产被搁置了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次展会上，我们将首次公布莱茵对万星园的后续研究成果，让不入流的科技公司心服口服，回到天空探索的领域，回到公众视野。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道生态园建立在环形实验室回传数据的基础上，也知道用植物传输能量、搭建供能系统在工程设计上是一大壮举。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"培育幼苗、铺设种植单元、工程检修，都是为了精进我们的实验......但一座在预展上都没机会露面的“植物园”真的足够吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恳请你告诉我，娜斯提主任。正如那个夜晚之前，没人知道克丽斯腾即将突破天幕，莱茵在这里还有更大的目标，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特里蒙的夜晚已经过去很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去准备下一家企业的检修吧。注意名单顺序，发生了一些调整。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯凯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解你的心情，也知道你是受到克丽斯腾的鼓舞才选择入职莱茵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上有很多人抬头看向天空，但不是所有人都会去追逐它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了让你迈出第一步的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯凯","speakerId":"avg_npc_2039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我先去准备检修资料了，主任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜斯提","speakerId":"avg_4212_nasti_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请拿好您的权限卡、协议和园区通用联络黄页，再次欢迎您的团队加入“螺旋桨天堂”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一位！请问有什么可以帮您的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注销进驻资质......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您代表的企业是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸运瘤兽餐饮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一共需要解约八十二名体验员是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，他们的资料连同我本人的都在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，麻烦稍等一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我是被影月砸了脑袋吗？确信自己参展之后一定能赚回本钱，就雇了八十二个没有企业工作经验的门外汉充场面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这里的所有企业都是这么干的，为什么被淘汰的偏偏是“幸运瘤兽”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为处理问题的速度慢了那么一点点，我上百万的金券就要打水漂了？开什么玩笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他妈的，一只靴子影月地产到底是怎么解决那个什么“三维浮空界桩”的技术问题的？就凭他们那群鞋匠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅斯彭先生，您的手续已经办理好了。今天之内，园区的热线电话依旧会向您开放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果您像一只靴子影月地产公司一样，有一些“特殊”需求......我们也很愿意为您处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你的意思是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"微笑的工作人员拿出园区内几乎人手一本的联络黄页，向雅斯彭指出了一个电话号码。\n没有抬头，没有地址，这串数字毫不起眼地藏身于几万个号码之中，就像雅斯彭微乎其微的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要打这个电话，我的问题就能解决？“幸运瘤兽”就可以不用离开园区？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我要撤回员工解雇合同，还有企业进驻资质的注销申请——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请放心，我并没有注销“幸运瘤兽”的进驻资格，不过体验员的解约协议无需撤回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这通热线会“彻底”解决您的问题，您再也不需要那些人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇迹，还是骗局......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅斯彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_2041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想了，只要能留在这里，试试又何妨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"68_g7_airrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高登长官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我猜猜，娜斯提虽然将信将疑，但还是收下了我拟定的名单，答应了我的提议，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我去确认了工程部今天的检修安排，完全按照您给定的顺序，一点不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，您是怎么知道的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道她的最终选择，我只知道我正在经历自己人生中最辉煌的日子，无论做什么都会顺心如意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看起来确实很高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小小一个莱茵主任还不足以调动我的情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桌子上那封信，你打开看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“烟酒施术单元以及源石制品管理局向高登·谭农长官发来贺函，祝贺您正式成为‘螺旋桨天堂’的总长官......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两页纸？我从来没见过这么长的贺函。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"六个月前我在哥伦比亚边境收到的调岗邮件里可只有两行字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人人都觉得管理局的职位是个肥差，但那七年里，我可没在萨米的野人和萨尔贡雨林的土著身上刮到“油水”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时老狐狸看我不顺眼，管理局的其他人也不给我好脸色。结果呢？他退休了，我升职了，真是风水轮流转。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然还是大白天，但这么高兴的日子，就应该——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小酌一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，您的香槟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小梅，做得不错。无论是娜斯提的事还是这杯酒，你在我身边也算是有些长进，给你自己也倒一杯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分感谢。不过根据秘书准则，工作时间不能饮酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在乎那些干什么，你的那本手册就是我瞎编的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......请您提两句祝酒词？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......六天后的展会只是个起点，我的开幕致辞必将轰动整个哥伦比亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会亲眼看着所有火箭的外壳都刻上我的头像，影月都市里最大的街区也会以我的名字命名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱茵、管理局、特区政府......没人能压到我的头上。只要不出岔子，这里永远是高登·谭农的“螺旋桨天堂”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干杯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？赶着来参加我的派对吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，请问您是园区总长官吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的男子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫奥克里，“螺旋桨天堂”特聘的讲解员，来找高登长官报到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅希亚","speakerId":"avg_npc_2037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高登","speakerId":"avg_npc_2034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"高登把刚刚喝进嘴里的香槟全部喷了出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
